## Content design and wayfinding

Principles (clarity, hierarchy, consistency, relevance):

- **Terminology:** Provider, Plan, Migration, Network map, Storage map — match existing MTV strings
- **Tabs:** Use for orthogonal detail views; do not hide required actions behind deep tab chains
- **Actions:** One clear primary action per view; secondary actions as links or secondary buttons
- **Labels:** Sentence case; helper text explains constraints (not implementation detail)
- **Errors:** What failed, why it matters, what to do next
- **i18n:** English keys in design notes; no concatenated user-facing strings

OpenShift Console UX: https://www.uxd-hub.com/areas/category/openshift  
Microcopy: https://www.uxd-hub.com/areas/content

